We obtain $\boxed{
  T_{\mu\nu}
  =
  \partial_\mu\phi\,\partial_\nu\phi
  -
  \frac12\eta_{\mu\nu}
  \partial_\alpha\phi\,\partial^\alpha\phi.}$ This is the canonical stress-energy tensor for a free massless real scalar field in flat spacetime.

